        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><ul>
<li>Marked Spigot / Paper 26.1.2 as compatible</li>
<li>Proxy installation no longer sends a ton of plugin messages to backend if tab expansion is disabled</li>
<li>Fixed memory leak</li>
<li>Fixed error in config conversion</li>
<li>Fixed startup error on Paper 1.20.5 - 1.21.4</li>
<li>Fixed startup error on NeoForge</li>
</ul></div>
</div>
